{
  "uid": "sms-a4-experiment",
  "title": "A4 Continuous Experimentation - UI Engagement Test",
  "tags": ["experiment", "a4", "ui-test", "engagement"],
  "editable": true,
  "description": "Experiment: Does the new UI (v2 canary) increase user engagement compared to stable (v1)? Hypothesis: Users who see the prettier v2 UI will send more requests per session than v1 users.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "5s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "interval",
        "type": "interval",
        "query": "30s,1m,5m,10m",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "1m", "value": "1m" },
        "label": "Interval"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Experiment Overview",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 4 },
      "options": {
      "content": "## Experiment: UI Engagement Test\n\n**Hypothesis:** The new UI (Canary v2) is more engaging and causes users to interact more frequently.\n\n**Setup:**\n- **Traffic Split:** 90% users see Stable (v1), 10% see Canary (v2)\n- **Metric:** We compare **Engagement Multiplier** (requests per user), not raw totals.\n\n**Decision Criteria:**\n-  **Accept v2** if: Engagement Multiplier > 1.2 (v2 users are >20% more active)\n-  **Reject v2** if: Engagement Multiplier < 0.8 (v2 users are less active)\n\n**Interpretation:**\n- Even if the **Yellow Line (v2)** is lower than Green (v1) on the graph, v2 might still be winning!\n- Look at the **Engagement Multiplier** panel for the normalized score.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Rate per Version (TOTAL TRAFFIC)",
      "description": "Shows aggregate traffic rates. Note: v2 (Yellow) has only 10% of users. If Yellow is near Green, v2 users are significantly more active per capita.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 24, "h": 10 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (version) (rate(sms_requests_total[$interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{version}} (Total)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "v1 (Total)" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "v2 (Total)" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "yellow", "mode": "fixed" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Engagement Multiplier (PER USER)",
      "description": "Normalized metric: (v2_rate / 0.1) / (v1_rate / 0.9). Values > 1.0 mean v2 users are more engaged.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 14, "w": 12, "h": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(sum(rate(sms_requests_total{version=\"v2\"}[$interval])) / 0.1) / (sum(rate(sms_requests_total{version=\"v1\"}[$interval])) / 0.9)",
          "legendFormat": "Multiplier",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": 0, "color": "red" },
              { "value": 0.8, "color": "yellow" },
              { "value": 1.2, "color": "green" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Decision Recommendation",
      "description": "Automated recommendation based on engagement multiplier.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 14, "w": 12, "h": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(sum(rate(sms_requests_total{version=\"v2\"}[$interval])) / 0.1) / (sum(rate(sms_requests_total{version=\"v1\"}[$interval])) / 0.9)",
          "legendFormat": "Verdict",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "range", "options": { "from": 0, "to": 0.8, "result": { "text": "❌ REJECT - Lower Engagement" } } },
            { "type": "range", "options": { "from": 0.8, "to": 1.2, "result": { "text": "⚠️ NEUTRAL - Similar Engagement" } } },
            { "type": "range", "options": { "from": 1.2, "to": 1.5, "result": { "text": "✅ ACCEPT - Higher Engagement" } } },
            { "type": "range", "options": { "from": 1.5, "to": 100, "result": { "text": "✅✅ STRONG ACCEPT - Much Higher Engagement" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": 0, "color": "red" },
              { "value": 0.8, "color": "yellow" },
              { "value": 1.0, "color": "light-green" },
              { "value": 1.5, "color": "green" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Ham vs Spam Classification Rate",
      "description": "Classification results by version. Verify both versions classify messages similarly (no regression in model behavior).",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 20, "w": 24, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (version, category) (rate(sms_prediction_result_total[$interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{version}} - {{category}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Total Requests per Version (Cumulative)",
      "description": "Absolute cumulative request counts. Shows total volume over time.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 28, "w": 24, "h": 10 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (version) (sms_requests_total)",
          "legendFormat": "{{version}} Total",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "P95 Latency per Version (Safety Metric)",
      "description": "Verify new UI doesn't degrade performance. Both versions should have similar latency.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 38, "w": 24, "h": 10 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (version, le) (rate(frontend_request_latency_seconds_bucket[$interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{version}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" }
}